"value": "Freezer (-20°C to -80°C) before reconstituting. Refrigerator (2°C to 8°C) after. Keep away from direct light and never freeze reconstituted solutions. See the <a class=\"ulink\" href=\"index.html#care\">Care Guide</a>.",
"tag": "p"
